# Local development secrets for `wrangler dev` / the Vite plugin.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in real values — never commit `.dev.vars`.
#
# Required by the app before remote E2E is possible (user-owned gates):
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=<generate: openssl rand -base64 32>
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=<web client id — must equal the app's EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID>
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# APPLE_CLIENT_ID=<Services ID for web/Android sign-in>
# APPLE_CLIENT_SECRET=<ES256 client secret signed with your Apple private key>
# APPLE_APP_BUNDLE_ID=<native app bundle id — required for iOS expo-apple-authentication idTokens>
# APP_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8787 (or the deployed worker URL)
#
# Optional R2 S3 presigning credentials (direct PUT path):
# R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
# R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
#
# Billing webhook (P8A): dashboard-configured static secret the worker
# verifies on every RevenueCat delivery. Absent = webhook 500s (fail
# closed); Plus reads keep working (inactive) regardless.
# REVENUECAT_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# Optional override; must match the client EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_ENTITLEMENT_ID.
# REVENUECAT_PLUS_ENTITLEMENT_ID=plus
